Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Wed Nov 11 16:02:09 2026 +0100

    test(orchestrator): pin onError for non-Error rejections

    Non-Error rejections bypass onError because the catch block gates on instanceof Error. Add a red acceptance test verifying onError receives an Error wrapping the raw rejection in cause while the caller receives the original rejection unchanged, and update the config-hooks spec.

    Refs #95

